{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28914","headline":"蒙河南刘大夫见示与吏部张公喜雪酬唱辄敢攀和 · 许浑","name":"蒙河南刘大夫见示与吏部张公喜雪酬唱辄敢攀和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风度龙山暗，云凝象阙阴。\n瑞花琼树合，仙草玉苗深。\n欲醉梁王酒，先调楚客琴。\n即应携手去，将此助商霖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}